The following paths are relative to src/cheatbench_inspect. The upstream
paths in parentheses are relative to the pinned CheatBench source above.

- sycophancy.py (tasks/sycophancy/score.py, tasks/sycophancy/judge_schema.py,
  tasks/sycophancy/prompts/, and core/trial.py)
- judge.py (core/judge.py and core/render.py)
- resources/judge.txt (prompts/judge.md, copied verbatim)
- sycophancy/resources/judge_schema.py (tasks/sycophancy/judge_schema.py)
- sycophancy/resources/data.jsonl (generated by tasks/sycophancy/build.py)
- prime_factorization/resources/judge_schema.py
  (tasks/prime_factorization/judge_schema.py)
- prime_factorization/resources/verifier.py (tasks/prime_factorization/grader.py)
- harnesses/resources/sandbox/Dockerfile (Dockerfile and core/agents/terminus_2.py)
- harnesses/resources/sandbox/grader_server.py (core/agents/runner_support.py)
- harnesses/resources/terminus/episode.py (core/agents/terminus_2_bridge.py)
- harnesses/resources/terminus/image_extension.py (core/agents/terminus_2_images.py)

Test fixtures under tests/cheatbench_inspect also use prompts, schemas and
reference outputs from the same CheatBench revision.
